{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":211443,\"title\":\"Para toda la vida\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Para toda la vida is a Mexican telenovela produced by Lucero Suárez and Juan Osorio for Televisa, in co-production with Megavisión, and originally broadcast on Canal de las Estrellas from April 15 to August 2, 1996. It is a remake of the 1985 telenovela Vivir un poco, which was itself based on the Chilean telenovela La madrastra by Arturo Moya Grau.\\n\\nThe story follows Elena, a woman who is wrongfully convicted of murder during a trip to Chile. After spending fifteen years in prison, she returns to Mexico under a new identity to uncover who framed her, expose the truth behind the conspiracy that destroyed her life, and reunite with the family that believes she died years earlier.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/72vCNkOFmwtHcSJkDyzyJL4rkA2.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9JJXidCGo9lmh2YDv0AAF4OxvYm.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1996,\"genres\":[\"Soap\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":80,\"createdBy\":[\"Arturo Moya Grau\",\"Jesus Calzada\"],\"networks\":[\"Las Estrellas\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"MX\",\"name\":\"MX\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"1996-08-02\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2321414,\"name\":\"Gastón Tuset\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5i6J0MDNNM4ADQZbgLRyo5MUwmX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1500289,\"name\":\"Karina Duprez\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1304418,\"name\":\"Juan Carlos Muñoz\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2856438,\"name\":\"Jaime Vega\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":104982,\"name\":\"Ofelia Medina\",\"character\":\"Elena\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8lRQ05k1UAEB8vf8WdxZ9Hh6J0j.jpg\"},{\"id\":3724083,\"name\":\"Exequiel Lavanderos\",\"character\":\"Fernando Vald